Table Name: dim_venue

Purpose:
Stores venue information used in matches.

Important Columns:

venue_name
city

Why Important?

Used to analyze:
- Chepauk performance
- Home advantage
- Venue-specific trends

Table Name: dim_player

Purpose:
Stores player information.

Important Columns:

player_name

Why Important?

Used to analyze:
- Top run scorers
- Top wicket takers
- Player performance trends
- Knockout performance



Table Name: dim_match

Purpose:
Stores match-level information.

Important Columns:

season
date
winner
toss_winner
toss_decision
venue_id

Why Important?

Used to analyze:
- Win %
- Toss impact
- Home advantage
- Seasonal trends


Table Name: fact_deliveries

Purpose:
Stores every ball bowled in every CSK match.

Important Columns:

match_id
innings_num
batting_team
bowling_team
over_num
ball_num
batter
bowler
runs_batter
runs_total
is_wicket
phase

Why Important?

This is the central fact table.

Used to calculate:

- Powerplay Run Rate
- Middle Overs Run Rate
- Death Overs Run Rate
- Dot Ball %
- Boundary %
- Wickets
- Economy Rate
- Strike Rate